Package: OHMmy
Title: Streamlined Single-Cell RNA-Seq Analysis and Visualization for Seurat v5
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Chomchon", "Uansiri", , "chomchom1910travel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive toolkit engineered for high-resolution single-cell RNA 
    sequencing (scRNA-seq) analysis. Built natively for 'Seurat' v5, this package 
    provides reproducible wrappers for ambient RNA decontamination using 'SoupX', 
    automated multi-modal data processing, and complex cell-state visualizations. 
    Key features include hierarchical dotplots, density feature blends via 'Nebulosa', 
    automated cluster demographic statistics, and integrated pipelines for functional 
    enrichment profiling (ORA and GSEA). It is specifically designed to handle highly 
    heterogeneous datasets while strictly managing technical noise.
